    <briefdescription>
<para>C++ object repersenting NAIF spice SPK Segment and it&apos;s metadata. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>SPK kernels consist of multiple CK segments. These specifically define a type 13 SPK segment which consists of parallel arrary of ephemeris times in a 6 element state array&apos;s of x, y, z, vx, vy, vz </para>
